  <p><strong>Non-Disparagement</strong>: Ambassadors agree not to make any statements, written or verbal, that disparage, defame, or discredit YOLLO Group Services, Inc., its products, services, or employees. This provision does not prohibit truthful statements required by legal process or applicable law.</p>
  
  <p><strong>Indemnification</strong>: Ambassadors agree to indemnify and hold harmless YOLLO Group Services, Inc., its affiliates, and employees from any claims, damages, or losses arising from their participation in the program. This indemnification extends to liabilities, damages, or costs, including legal fees, resulting from any violation of these terms.</p>